<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 6.48 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 6.48 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 6.48 percent in the week ending November 2 from 6.57 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES	 Nov 2	 Oct 26	Nov 4, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change     +6.48	 +6.57	  +8.84</p>
<p>    Index (base = 1981/82) 318.6	 317.9	  299.2</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those in week ended November 4, 1995.</p>
</text>
